# One possible strain: a dreamless night is judged "more pleasant" afterwards, by someone who wakes. Nothingness has no one to enjoy it.
# But dreamless_best is read the same way in P2 and P4. P4 joins it to gain_nothing, a different claim, so P4 is not a bridge on one word.
# "gain" (A1) and "good" (A2, C) both mean good for the one who dies, so A1 and A2 do not shift the sense of "good".
